[0m09:56:26.446103 [debug] [Thread-4 (]: Using duckdb connection "model.news_warehouse.weekly_source_comparison"
[0m09:56:26.447158 [debug] [Thread-2 (]: Using duckdb connection "model.news_warehouse.fct_daily_sentiment"
